# Only the landing page is deployed. Everything else in this monorepo is source
# for the npm package and the container image, and has no business on a CDN --
# including idea.txt, which is deliberately unpublished.
#
# This applies to git deployments as well as to `vercel deploy`, which is why
# `.git` has to survive it: vercel.json's ignoreCommand runs `git diff` after
# these rules have been applied, and without a repository it cannot answer.
/*
!/site
!/.git
